{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_017j3RjefJ1yeDuiQKr2aieD", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lofi_Girl\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Pablo_Machado\"}, {\"url\": \"https://beatstorapon.com/blog/lofi-girl-from-youtube-study-stream-to-global-chill-beats-icon/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kzsc.org/blog/2021/11/27/who-is-the-lofi-girl/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.reasonwhy.es/actualidad/fans-reimaginan-lofi-hip-hop-girl-diferentes-paises\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dailydot.com/entertainment/lofi-girl-youtube-behind-the-lore/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://production-blue.amara.org/videos/sL80apqAtTSs/info/the-science-behind-lofi-music\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nssmag.com/it/lifestyle/30376/lofi-girl\"}, {\"url\": \"https://edgeworkscreative.com/blog/friday-props-machado\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zhwiki.oracleblog.org/zh-hans/Lofi_Girl\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:03:26.747Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Lofi Girl study girl logo illustrator Colombian artist Juan Pablo Machado", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01Afji5bRhJEM51WeTaAh1zf", "content": [{"title": "Lofi Girl", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lofi_Girl"}, {"title": "Juan Pablo Machado", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Pablo_Machado"}, {"title": "Lofi Girl: From YouTube Study Stream to Global Chill Beats Icon", "url": "https://beatstorapon.com/blog/lofi-girl-from-youtube-study-stream-to-global-chill-beats-icon/"}, {"title": "who is the lofi girl", "url": "https://kzsc.org/blog/2021/11/27/who-is-the-lofi-girl/"}, {"title": "ColaCao y Lay's aparecen en la versión española de la “Lo-Fi Hip Hop Girl”", "url": "https://www.reasonwhy.es/actualidad/fans-reimaginan-lofi-hip-hop-girl-diferentes-paises"}, {"title": "lofi girl youtube behind the lore", "url": "https://dailydot.com/entertainment/lofi-girl-youtube-behind-the-lore/"}, {"title": "the science behind lofi music", "url": "https://production-blue.amara.org/videos/sL80apqAtTSs/info/the-science-behind-lofi-music"}, {"title": "lofi girl", "url": "https://www.nssmag.com/it/lifestyle/30376/lofi-girl"}, {"title": "friday props machado", "url": "https://edgeworkscreative.com/blog/friday-props-machado"}, {"title": "Lofi Girl", "url": "https://zhwiki.oracleblog.org/zh-hans/Lofi_Girl"}]}, "Juan Pablo Machado is the Colombian-French artist behind the Lofi Girl study girl, and the sources agree on the basic story.\n\n- **Background:** Machado is originally from Cali, Colombia. He moved to Lyon in 2013 to study at the École Émile-Cohl after an art school stint in Bogotá.\n- **How he got the job:** The channel, then ChilledCow, had lost its original Studio Ghibli-derived visual. Its stream had been taken down due to copyright infringement, so it called for an artist. Machado answered while still a student, and the tender called for a \"student busy revising for her classes, with Miyazaki-esque visuals.\"\n- **Design choices:** Reports say several positions were tested for the Lofi Girl, but a more complex pose was dropped because it took too long to animate. The background was first plain black, but Machado later placed La Croix-Rousse in the window instead. The lighting also changes based on the time; sunrise, daytime, sunset, and nighttime.\n- **Later:** The channel rebranded on 18 March 2021 for its sixth anniversary, taking the official name Lofi Girl.\n\nSources differ on details. Some say Machado was approached in 2017 and others in 2018, and one Italian source names the character Jade, which the English sources don't mention. The Wikipedia pages are the most consistent on dates and biography."], "durationSeconds": 4.944802041999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_017j3RjefJ1yeDuiQKr2aieD", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
